model_response:
Let’s check by multiplying **each entry** by \(-\frac{3}{8}\):

\[
\begin{pmatrix}
-\frac{3}{8}(2) & -\frac{3}{8}(1) & -\frac{3}{8}(-10)\\
-\frac{3}{8}(3) & -\frac{3}{8}(-9) & -\frac{3}{8}(-3)
\end{pmatrix}
=
\begin{pmatrix}
-\frac{3}{4} & -\frac{3}{8} & \frac{15}{4}\\
-\frac{9}{8} & \frac{27}{8} & \frac{9}{8}
\end{pmatrix}.
\]

The original answer is correct. Which entry do you believe is incorrect?

