model_response:
Subtract row 2 from row 1, which leaves the determinant unchanged:
\[
\det\begin{pmatrix}
0&0&2\\
4&3&1\\
-3&1&1
\end{pmatrix}
=2\det\begin{pmatrix}4&3\\-3&1\end{pmatrix}
=2\bigl(4+9\bigr)=\boxed{26}.
\]

