model_response:
Row-reducing,
\[
\begin{pmatrix}
-3&-4\\
5&6\\
9&0
\end{pmatrix}
\xrightarrow{R_1\leftarrow-\frac13R_1}
\begin{pmatrix}
1&\frac43\\
5&6\\
9&0
\end{pmatrix}
\xrightarrow[\ R_3\leftarrow R_3-9R_1\ ]{R_2\leftarrow R_2-5R_1}
\begin{pmatrix}
1&\frac43\\
0&-\frac23\\
0&-12
\end{pmatrix}.
\]
Now scale \(R_2\) by \(-\frac32\), then use it to clear the second column:
\[
\begin{pmatrix}
1&\frac43\\
0&1\\
0&-12
\end{pmatrix}
\xrightarrow[\ R_3\leftarrow R_3+12R_2\ ]{R_1\leftarrow R_1-\frac43R_2}
\boxed{\begin{pmatrix}
1&0\\
0&1\\
0&0
\end{pmatrix}}.
\]

