Here, \(\sum x_i=41\) and \(\sum x_i^2=503\), so
\[
s=\sqrt{\frac{\sum x_i^2-(\sum x_i)^2/n}{n-1}}
=\sqrt{\frac{503-41^2/6}{5}}
=\sqrt{\frac{1337}{30}}
\approx \boxed{6.676}.
\]

