Yes—rechecking confirms \(\boxed{320}\).

Since \(820=2^2\cdot5\cdot41\), Euler’s formula gives
\[
\phi(820)=820\cdot\frac12\cdot\frac45\cdot\frac{40}{41}
=410\cdot\frac45\cdot\frac{40}{41}
=328\cdot\frac{40}{41}
=320.
\]

