model_response:
The determinant is
\[
(-2)(-3)-\left(-\frac12\right)\left(\frac72\right)
=6+\frac74=\frac{31}{4}\ne0.
\]
Thus the pseudoinverse equals the ordinary inverse:
\[
\boxed{
A^{+}=A^{-1}
=\frac{4}{31}
\begin{pmatrix}
-3 & \frac12\\[2pt]
-\frac72 & -2
\end{pmatrix}
=\frac1{31}
\begin{pmatrix}
-12 & 2\\
-14 & -8
\end{pmatrix}.
}
\]

