\]
Thus the pseudoinverse equals the ordinary inverse:
\[
\boxed{
A^{+}=A^{-1}
=\frac{4}{63}
\begin{pmatrix}
-1&5\\
-3&-\frac34
\end{pmatrix}
=
\begin{pmatrix}
-\frac{4}{63}&\frac{20}{63}\\[2pt]
-\frac{4}{21}&-\frac{1}{21}
\end{pmatrix}.
}
\]

