model_response:
Rechecking the cofactor expansion, the determinant is indeed **\(40\)**:
\[
\begin{aligned}
\det A
&=-3\begin{vmatrix}4&-2\\4&3\end{vmatrix}
-\begin{vmatrix}2&-2\\-3&3\end{vmatrix}
+5\begin{vmatrix}2&4\\-3&4\end{vmatrix}\\
&=-3(12+8)-(6-6)+5(8+12)\\
&=\boxed{40}.
\end{aligned}
\]
If you share the cited result, I can help identify the discrepancy—perhaps the source uses a different matrix.

