model_response:
The sample mean is \(\bar{x}=8\). Thus the sample standard deviation is
\[
s=\sqrt{\frac{\sum (x_i-\bar{x})^2}{n-1}}
=\sqrt{\frac{121+25+9+4+1}{4}}
=\sqrt{40}
=\boxed{2\sqrt{10}\approx 6.325}.
\]

