model_response:
The determinant is \(4(-3)-5(-1)=-7\neq 0\), so the pseudoinverse equals the ordinary inverse:
\[
\boxed{
A^{+}=A^{-1}
=\frac{1}{-7}
\begin{pmatrix}
-3 & -5\\
1 & 4
\end{pmatrix}
=\frac17
\begin{pmatrix}
3 & 5\\
-1 & -4
\end{pmatrix}.
}
\]

