model_response:
Scaling every entry by \(10\) multiplies the determinant by \(10^3\). Thus, expanding along the first row,
\[
\begin{aligned}
\det A
&=\frac1{1000}
\begin{vmatrix}
-5&8&20\\
10&-19&-20\\
43&-33&-49
\end{vmatrix}\\
&=\frac{-5(931-660)-8(-490+860)+20(-330+817)}{1000}\\
&=\frac{-1355-2960+9740}{1000}
=\boxed{\frac{217}{40}}.
\end{aligned}
\]

