model_response:
Multiplying every entry by \(10\) scales the determinant by \(10^3\). Thus
\[
\begin{aligned}
\det A
&=\frac1{1000}
\begin{vmatrix}
-5&6&1\\
-44&39&-18\\
24&29&-50
\end{vmatrix}\\
&=\frac1{1000}\left[-5(-1950+522)-6(2200+432)+(-1276-936)\right]\\
&=\frac{7140-15792-2212}{1000}
=\boxed{-\frac{1358}{125}}.
\end{aligned}
\]

