model_response:
The mean is \(\bar{x}=(-2-4-3)/3=-3\). Thus the sample variance is
\[
s^2=\frac{\sum (x_i-\bar{x})^2}{n-1}
=\frac{1^2+(-1)^2+0^2}{2}
=\boxed{1}.
\]

