The sample mean is \(\bar{x}=(7+6-5-8)/4=0\). Thus the sample variance is
\[
s^2=\frac{\sum (x_i-\bar{x})^2}{n-1}
=\frac{49+36+25+64}{3}
=\boxed{58}.
\]

