model_response:
The mean is \(\bar{x}=\frac{3+5+13-15+11}{5}=3.4\).

The **sample standard deviation** is
\[
s=\sqrt{\frac{\sum(x_i-\bar{x})^2}{5-1}}
=\sqrt{\frac{491.2}{4}}
=\sqrt{122.8}
\approx \boxed{11.08}.
\]

